#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "So OP!"
msgstr "완전 사기다!"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "HELLO I AM "
msgstr "안녕 나는 "

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "WARNING: EXTREMELY BUGGY"
msgstr "경고: 버그 엄청 많음"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "MECHAMOUNTIE IS ESPECIALLY BUGGY! USE AT OWN RISK!"
msgstr "메카마운티는 특히 버그가 많다! 각자 책임하에 사용할 것!"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "You've recruited enough overpowered characters! I'm cutting you off!"
msgstr "사기 캐릭터는 충분히 영입했다! 이제 그만!"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "You can recruit "
msgstr "사기 캐릭터를 더 영입할 수 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid " more overpowered characters!"
msgstr "명!"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "일단 "

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid " for now"
msgstr "을(를) 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "Ask "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid " to join"
msgstr "에게 합류 요청"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "Familiar Faces"
msgstr "낯익은 얼굴들"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "GO TO THE FAMILIAR CHARACTERS HUT?"
msgstr "친숙한 캐릭터 오두막으로 갈까?"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid ""
"This will teleport you to a small area that contains all your previously "
"created Custom Characters!"
msgstr "이전에 만든 커스텀 캐릭터가 전부 있는 작은 구역으로 순간이동한다!"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid ""
"WARNING: This will leave the OPP Characters Area! \r\n"
"\tNo going back if you pick 'YES'!"
msgstr ""
"경고: 사기 캐릭터 구역을 떠나게 된다! \r\n"
"\t'예'를 고르면 되돌아올 수 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "NO"
msgstr "아니요"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "YES"
msgstr "예"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "seems quiet, or possibly has no personality whatsoever."
msgstr "은(는) 조용하거나, 어쩌면 성격이라는 게 아예 없는 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "is the Queen of all Fae Folk."
msgstr "은(는) 모든 요정족의 여왕이다."

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "is a panda. Real cute unless angered."
msgstr "은(는) 판다다. 화나게 하지만 않으면 진짜 귀엽다."

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "was surprised that he even joined the team, being a hermit and all."
msgstr "은(는) 은둔자인 주제에 일행에 합류했다는 사실에 자기도 놀랐다."

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "is a funny clown!"
msgstr "은(는) 웃긴 광대다!"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:436
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "CHARACTER LOUNGE"
msgstr "캐릭터 라운지"

#: deathforth/events/OPPmode.df:447
msgctxt "deathforth/events/OPPmode.df"
msgid "EXPERIMENTAL - USE AT OWN RISK"
msgstr "실험 중 - 각자 책임하에 사용"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " takes an hour to read the anime."
msgstr "은(는) 한 시간 동안 애니를 읽는다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " loves anime!!! Reading this bestows "
msgstr "은(는) 애니를 사랑한다!!! 이걸 읽으니 얻게 된다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "MYSTERIOUS ANIME POWERS!"
msgstr "신비한 애니의 힘!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
" is an uncultured swine that lacks the refined tastes necessary to "
"appreciate this work."
msgstr "은(는) 이 작품을 감상할 만한 고상한 취향이 없는 무식한 돼지다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " is a person of culture and taste and greatly appreciates this anime."
msgstr "은(는) 교양과 취향을 갖춘 사람이라 이 애니를 아주 높이 평가한다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:21
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "Leave it alone for now"
msgstr "일단 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " reads the anime"
msgstr "이(가) 애니를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:26
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:35
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "Anime Found"
msgstr "애니 발견"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:28
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:37
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " finds an anime titled "
msgstr "은(는) 이런 제목의 애니를 발견한다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "SANDWICH-CHAN"
msgstr "샌드위치쨩"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t It's a graphic novel about a magical anime girl who is also a sandwich that lives in a refrigerator. Or maybe it's a sandwich that is also a magical anime girl. \r\n"
"\t The plot is a little difficult to follow."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t 냉장고에 사는, 샌드위치이기도 한 마법 소녀에 대한 그래픽 노블이다. 아니면 마법 소녀이기도 한 샌드위치일지도. \r\n"
"\t 줄거리를 따라가기가 좀 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "I CAN'T BELIEVE MY FIANCE IS SOME KIND OF FISH CREATURE!"
msgstr "내 약혼자가 물고기 같은 생물이라니 말도 안 돼!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t It's a comic about a woman who has a dreary job in an office. Her life is brightened by getting a pet fish that has a human face and talks. \r\n"
"\t The plot involves them having to eventually get married due to a wizard's curse."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t 사무실에서 따분한 일을 하는 여자에 대한 만화다. 사람 얼굴을 하고 말하는 애완 물고기를 키우면서 그녀의 삶이 밝아진다. \r\n"
"\t 결국 마법사의 저주 때문에 둘이 결혼해야 하는 이야기다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "BAG OF PISTACHIOS"
msgstr "피스타치오 한 봉지"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t It's an anime about a bag of pistachios. The protagonist is surprised to discover the pistachios are sentient. Every pistachio is a different anime girl.\r\n"
"\t There doesn't really seem to be a plot."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t 피스타치오 한 봉지에 대한 애니다. 주인공은 피스타치오들에게 지각이 있다는 걸 알고 놀란다. 피스타치오 하나하나가 다른 애니 소녀다.\r\n"
"\t 줄거리는 딱히 없는 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " is now officially an anime girl! Nice!"
msgstr "은(는) 이제 공식적으로 애니 소녀다! 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "Mysterious Anime Box"
msgstr "신비한 애니 상자"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " finds a box of anime. It contains a bunch of anime girl masks."
msgstr "은(는) 애니 상자를 발견한다. 애니 소녀 가면이 잔뜩 들어 있다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " puts the anime mask on"
msgstr "이(가) 애니 가면을 쓴다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "'s mind is completely blown by the existence of "
msgstr "은(는) 이 존재 때문에 정신이 완전히 날아간다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "ANIME IS REAL!"
msgstr "애니는 실존한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "The purity of "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "'s love for anime halts the "
msgstr "의 순수한 애니 사랑이 멈춰 세운다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "CURSE OF ANIME"
msgstr "애니의 저주"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " that was placed on "
msgstr ". 그 저주가 걸려 있던 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "! Enjoy!"
msgstr "! 즐겨라!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:79
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:87
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:95
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid "The Anime Club"
msgstr "애니 동아리"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " seems irritated by "
msgstr "은(는) 짜증 난 것 같다. 이유는 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
"'s existence.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"의 존재.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:81
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:89
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:97
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
"I guess we can help you out, but it's not because we like you or anything!"
msgstr "딱히 너희가 좋아서 도와주는 건 아니거든!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " looks at "
msgstr "은(는) 쳐다본다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
" with a quiet sense of superiority.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"을(를). 조용한 우월감을 품고.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " seems troubled and nervous. Not because of "
msgstr "은(는) 불안하고 초조해 보인다. 딱히 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid ""
", just in general.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 때문은 아니고, 그냥 전반적으로.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/animestore.df"
msgid " doesn't say anything, but starts following "
msgstr "은(는) 아무 말 없이 따라가기 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid ""
"The experience is reminiscent of the days before the world got destroyed by "
"zombies. A relief washes over "
msgstr "좀비가 세상을 망치기 전 시절이 떠오르는 경험이다. 안도감이 밀려온다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:34 deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "Nothing Unusual Here"
msgstr "특별할 것 없음"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "It's a toilet."
msgstr "변기다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:36 deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid " doesn't need to use it right now."
msgstr "은(는) 지금은 쓸 필요가 없다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "FINALLY!"
msgstr "드디어!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid " can't believe "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid " eyes: "
msgstr " 눈을 믿을 수 없다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid ""
"An actual functioning toilet!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"진짜로 작동하는 변기!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "This opportunity mustn't be wasted. Should "
msgstr "이 기회를 놓칠 순 없다. 써야 할까: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:40 deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid " use it?"
msgstr "?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:41 deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "Leave it be"
msgstr "그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid ": I've been holding it in too long!"
msgstr ": 너무 오래 참았어!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid ""
" runs a warm water shower and gets all soapy. A pastime long forgotten, "
"returned."
msgstr "은(는) 따뜻한 물로 샤워하며 비누 거품을 낸다. 오래전 잊었던 일상이 돌아왔다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "It's a shower."
msgstr "샤워기다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "A Clean Shower"
msgstr "깨끗한 샤워"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid ""
"There's a shower that runs with water here. Amazing!\r\n"
"\tShould "
msgstr ""
"여기 물이 나오는 샤워기가 있다. 놀랍다!\r\n"
"\t써야 할까: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid ": I gotta get clean!"
msgstr ": 깨끗이 씻어야 해!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "좋아, 가자."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "Kick someone from the group:"
msgstr "일행에서 뺄 사람:"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid " finds "
msgstr "은(는) 발견한다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "some guy"
msgstr "웬 녀석"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid ""
" standing alone, here. \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
". 여기 혼자 서 있다. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "Sup? I'm just relaxing here, I'll come with ya if you want me to."
msgstr "안녕? 그냥 여기서 쉬는 중이야. 원하면 따라갈게."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "Leave him for now"
msgstr "일단 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/arq.df"
msgid "Recruit him"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "He fwinks out his claws with a little "
msgstr "그가 작은 소리를 내며 발톱을 꺼낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "fwiiiiiink"
msgstr "쓰으으윽"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid ""
" noise.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
".\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "Let's hit the road, BUB!"
msgstr "출발하자고, 친구!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid ""
" needs a surprising amount of room in the car. You'll have to get rid of "
"someone:"
msgstr "은(는) 차에서 의외로 자리를 많이 차지한다. 누군가 빼야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "You're my new best friend, "
msgstr "넌 내 새 절친이야, "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "Fierce Small Hairy Man"
msgstr "사납고 작은 털북숭이 남자"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid ""
"It looks like a small hairy man. Maybe some sort of new gnome species? It's weird that gnomes never were seen before the zombocalypse.\r\n"
"\tSorry, I got off-topic."
msgstr ""
"작은 털북숭이 남자처럼 생겼다. 혹시 새로운 노움 종일까? 좀비 사태 전엔 노움을 본 적이 없었다니 이상하다.\r\n"
"\t미안, 얘기가 샜다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "What do you want, BUB?"
msgstr "뭘 원해, 친구?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "Leave him alone for now"
msgstr "일단 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/bogan.df"
msgid "Recruit him"
msgstr "영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "Should "
msgstr "고양이를 영입할까? 결정은 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid " recruit the cat?"
msgstr "에게."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "BONUS: Oscar's morale always stays above zero!"
msgstr "보너스: 오스카의 사기는 항상 0 이상을 유지한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid ""
" offers the cat some food.\r\n"
"\t\tThe cat sniffs at it carefully, then devours it in an instant. It decides not to kill "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 고양이에게 먹이를 내민다.\r\n"
"\t\t고양이는 조심스럽게 냄새를 맡더니 순식간에 먹어 치운다. 고양이는 일단 지금은 죽이지 않기로 한다. 살아남은 건 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid " at this moment in time."
msgstr "."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid " has no food right now! Hopefully there's some in a nearby building..."
msgstr "은(는) 지금 식량이 없다! 근처 건물에 좀 있으면 좋겠는데..."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid ""
"Well, your call, I suppose.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"뭐, 네 선택이지.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid " reaches out to poke the cat but is interrupted due to "
msgstr "은(는) 고양이를 쿡 찌르려고 손을 뻗지만, 이것 때문에 중단된다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "GETTING MURDERED"
msgstr "살해당함"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid " by a flurry of claws and bites."
msgstr ". 발톱과 이빨의 폭풍에."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "The Last Good Cat"
msgstr "마지막 착한 고양이"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid ""
" finds a cat that has made its den here. It seems different than all other post-zombocalypse cats. \r\n"
"\t\t\tThe cat is super calm and doesn't radiate a desire to murder humans! How bizarre!\r\n"
"\t\t\tHe is wearing a name tag that reads:"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 여기에 굴을 튼 고양이를 발견한다. 좀비 사태 이후의 다른 고양이들과는 달라 보인다. \r\n"
"\t\t\t고양이가 엄청 차분하고 인간을 죽이고 싶어 하는 기운이 없다! 이상하다!\r\n"
"\t\t\t이름표에는 이렇게 적혀 있다:"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid " OSCAR"
msgstr " 오스카"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "Leave Oscar behind"
msgstr "오스카를 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "Recruit Oscar!"
msgstr "오스카 영입!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "The Cat Nest"
msgstr "고양이 둥지"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid ""
" finds a cat that has made its den in this trashed house. The cat stares at "
msgstr "은(는) 엉망이 된 이 집에 굴을 튼 고양이를 발견한다. 고양이가 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid " with a lazy glance that is tinged with "
msgstr "를 나른하게 쳐다본다. 그 눈빛에 묻어 있는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "MURDEROUS INTENT."
msgstr "살의."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "WARNING: Will kill you. If not now, maybe later."
msgstr "경고: 죽는다. 지금이 아니면 나중에라도."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "Leave it alone"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "Poke the cat! Yeah!"
msgstr "고양이를 찌른다! 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/catnest.df"
msgid "Coax it with food"
msgstr "먹이로 꼬드긴다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "MAXIMUM STRENGTH, FITNESS, AND SHOOTING INCREASED!"
msgstr "최대 근력, 체력, 사격 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:25
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:33
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "The "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " grants a gift!"
msgstr "이(가) 선물을 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid ""
" shakes hands with no hesitation! Making friends is fun.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 망설임 없이 악수한다! 친구 사귀는 건 즐거워.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " gets blasted with tremendous amounts of "
msgstr "은(는) 엄청난 양의 이것에 휩싸인다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "DEATH ENERGY!"
msgstr "죽음의 에너지!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " is killed!"
msgstr "은(는) 죽었다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " Well, almost."
msgstr " 음, 거의."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " - MAXIMUM HEALTH SET TO 1!"
msgstr " - 최대 체력이 1로 설정됨!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " feels really smug for some reason."
msgstr "은(는) 왠지 모르게 엄청 우쭐하다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " feels "
msgstr "은(는) 느낀다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "EVEN MORE BERSERK!"
msgstr "더욱더 광폭해짐!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "ARE YOU ABSOLUTELY SURE YOU WANT TO SHAKE HANDS WITH DEATH?"
msgstr "정말로 죽음과 악수하고 싶은 거 확실해?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "This probably isn't the best deal for "
msgstr "이건 아마 좋은 거래가 아닐 거다. 손해 보는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Don't do it!"
msgstr "하지 마!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Have someone else do it!"
msgstr "다른 사람한테 시켜!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Shake hands! Do it!"
msgstr "악수해! 해 버려!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "The Grim Specter of Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드의 음산한 사신"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid ""
", Avatar of Death Itself, emerges from the crypt.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
", 죽음 그 자체의 화신이 지하 묘소에서 나온다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " looks around at the hordes and the carnage. It looks at "
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 떼와 학살 현장을 둘러본다. 그러다 쳐다본다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid ". It shrugs."
msgstr ". 어깨를 으쓱한다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Try to ignore it for now"
msgstr "일단 무시해 본다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Shake hands with Death!"
msgstr "죽음과 악수한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Just Like in My Twilight Novels"
msgstr "내 트와일라잇 소설이랑 똑같잖아"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Hey, it's Dracula! Hi, Dracula."
msgstr "어, 드라큘라다! 안녕, 드라큘라."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " BLUHD! BLAUGH!"
msgstr " 피이! 블러억!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " never thought "
msgstr "은(는) 생각도 못 했다. "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "'d meet a celebrity! He doesn't mind doing some of his catchphrases."
msgstr "가 유명인을 만날 줄은! 그는 유행어 몇 개쯤은 기꺼이 해 준다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Should "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " recruit "
msgstr "은(는) 영입해야 할까: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "? He seems pretty lonely from being stuffed in a crypt for so long."
msgstr "? 지하 묘소에 너무 오래 갇혀 있어서 꽤 외로워 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid ""
" opens up the mausoleum, which seems like a horrible idea in the "
"zombopocalype."
msgstr "은(는) 영묘를 연다. 좀비 종말에 하기엔 끔찍한 생각 같다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Something emerges from the tomb as "
msgstr "무덤에서 뭔가가 나온다. 문을 연 건 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " opens it! I hope it's a "
msgstr "! 제발 이거였으면: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:88
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:104
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "goblin"
msgstr "고블린"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid ""
"Nothing special in this one. It's likely that this is a decoy for the one "
"the "
msgstr "여긴 특별한 게 없다. 아마 진짜 사는 곳을 숨기려는 미끼일 거다. 누가 사냐면 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " is really living in."
msgstr "."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Just more tomb stuff! Your obsession with tombs and "
msgstr "그냥 무덤 물건뿐이다! 무덤과 이것에 대한 집착이 통제 불능이 되어 가고 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "goblins"
msgstr "고블린"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " is veering out of control!"
msgstr "!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Spooky Mausoleum"
msgstr "으스스한 영묘"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "There may be a "
msgstr "여기 숨어 있을지도 모른다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid " hiding in here."
msgstr "."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "It would be easy to pry the door open with the crowbar."
msgstr "쇠지렛대로 문을 쉽게 비틀어 열 수 있겠다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "The shovel could pry the door open, with some effort."
msgstr "삽으로 좀 애쓰면 문을 비틀어 열 수 있겠다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "The door would be no match for a good sledgehammer."
msgstr "좋은 큰 망치 앞에선 이 문도 상대가 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:137
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "The pickaxe would break this door into pieces."
msgstr "곡괭이로 이 문을 산산조각 낼 수 있겠다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Open the Tomb"
msgstr "무덤을 연다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid "Leave it for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/cemetery.df"
msgid ""
"The door is solid and shut tight. You'd need something to pry it open with. "
"A shovel would work. There must be one nearby."
msgstr "문이 단단히 닫혀 있다. 비틀어 열 도구가 필요하다. 삽이면 된다. 근처에 하나쯤 있을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df"
msgid "The Spandex League"
msgstr "스판덱스 리그"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df"
msgid ""
" finds a comic book in good condition among the ruined ones littering the floor. \r\n"
"\tIt seems to be about burly superheroes in tights that run around and punch people. Great!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 바닥에 널린 망가진 만화책들 사이에서 멀쩡한 만화책 한 권을 발견한다. \r\n"
"\t쫄쫄이를 입은 우락부락한 슈퍼히어로들이 뛰어다니며 사람을 때리는 내용 같다. 좋아!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df"
msgid " stuffs it into "
msgstr "는 집어넣는다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/comicstore.df"
msgid " pack."
msgstr " 가방에."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/disco-51.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/disco-51.df"
msgid "Area 51 "
msgstr "51구역 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/disco-51.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/disco-51.df"
msgid "ALL NIGHT "
msgstr "밤새도록 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/disco-51.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/disco-51.df"
msgid "Disco"
msgstr "디스코"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "'s name is now "
msgstr "의 이름은 이제 이거다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "! The driver's license says so! It's legally binding!"
msgstr "! 운전면허증에 그렇게 적혀 있다! 법적 효력이 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " doesn't really mind the name too much. It's kind of fitting!"
msgstr "은(는) 이 이름이 그렇게 싫지 않다. 꽤 잘 어울린다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " instantly forms a massive chip on "
msgstr "은(는) 단숨에 엄청난 앙심을 품는다. "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " shoulder. "
msgstr " 마음속에 응어리가 생긴다. "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " enters a permanent state of simmering rage!"
msgstr "는 영원히 부글부글 끓는 분노 상태에 들어간다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "What a completely awful new name!"
msgstr "완전 최악의 새 이름이다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "This is still better than "
msgstr "그래도 이게 더 낫다. 뭐보다? "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " previous name."
msgstr " 예전 이름보다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid ""
" was the most popular name for centuries in the Late Medieval era, for both "
"girls and boys. It was thought that it provided a blessing of good health."
msgstr "은(는) 중세 후기에 수백 년 동안 남녀 모두에게 가장 인기 있던 이름이었다. 건강의 축복을 준다고 믿었다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " feels way past cool with "
msgstr "은(는) 새 이름이 엄청 쿨하다고 느낀다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " new name!"
msgstr " 새 이름!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "What should the name be on the driver's license?"
msgstr "운전면허증에 어떤 이름을 넣을까?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "A License... to Drive"
msgstr "면허... 운전할 면허"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid ""
"I can't believe you skipped the line! Very rude!\r\n"
"\tThis is a machine used to print driver's licenses.\r\n"
"\tIt can print one final license before running out of supplies."
msgstr ""
"줄을 새치기하다니 믿을 수가 없네! 정말 무례해!\r\n"
"\t운전면허증을 인쇄하는 기계다.\r\n"
"\t재료가 다 떨어지기 전에 마지막으로 한 장 더 뽑을 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " could use a new one, "
msgstr "은(는) 새 면허증이 필요할지도 모른다. "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid " license is about to expire!"
msgstr " 면허증이 곧 만료되니까!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "Leave it for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/dmv.df"
msgid "Print new license"
msgstr "새 면허증 인쇄"

