msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid " natural charm to coax the panda to follow."
msgstr " 타고난 매력으로 판다를 꼬드겨 따라오게 한다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid "The panda just seems irritated by "
