msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid ""
"WARNING: Will probably kill you unless you're offering it food. Is a dingus "
"with 50% chance to waste your food."
msgstr "경고: 먹이를 주지 않으면 아마 죽는다. 50% 확률로 먹이를 낭비하는 멍청이다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid "Leave it alone"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid "Pull the panda along"
msgstr "판다를 끌고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid "Lure it with food"
msgstr "먹이로 꼬드긴다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid "Coax it with charm"
msgstr "매력으로 달랜다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/panda.df"
msgid "is a panda. Real cute unless angered."
msgstr "은(는) 판다다. 화나게 하지만 않으면 진짜 귀엽다."

