msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "OMNI-BIO-CORP LABS"
msgstr "옴니-바이오-코프 연구소"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ", which sounds way too evil to be a real company."
msgstr ". 진짜 회사라기엔 너무 사악하게 들린다."

