msgstr "콘크리트 벙커"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" sees a monstrous army of zombs near a forest road! They are milling around "
"a small concrete structure jutting from the ground."
msgstr "은(는) 숲길 근처에서 거대한 좀비 군대를 본다! 땅에서 튀어나온 작은 콘크리트 구조물 주변을 서성이고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:37
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Check it out"
msgstr "살펴본다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Junkyard Rescue"
msgstr "고물상 구출"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " escapes the junkyard!"
msgstr "은(는) 고물상을 탈출한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
