msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " some shooting tips!"
msgstr "!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "'s adventures have ended."
msgstr "의 모험은 끝났다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Junkyard Pals"
msgstr "고물상 친구들"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" sees two people get trapped in a junkyard by a massive crowd of zombies. "
"They could be saved from their fates, if you distract the horde!"
msgstr "은(는) 두 사람이 거대한 좀비 무리 때문에 고물상에 갇히는 걸 본다. 좀비 떼의 주의를 돌리면 그들을 구할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Save them!"
msgstr "구하자!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Fishing Cabins"
msgstr "낚시 오두막"

