msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" notices a small row of fishing cabins past a river. Let's go fishing! "
"You're out of luck if underwater creatures are having their own zombie "
"apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 강 건너편에 늘어선 작은 낚시 오두막들을 발견한다. 낚시하러 가자! 물속 생물들도 자기들만의 좀비 종말을 겪고 있다면 운이 없는"
" 거고."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Try fishing"
msgstr "낚시를 해 본다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Museum Field Trip"
msgstr "박물관 견학"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" drives close to a museum. It must have been popular, as the undead are "
msgstr "은(는) 박물관 근처를 지나간다. 인기가 많았던 모양이다. 언데드가 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "out in droves."
msgstr "떼로 몰려 있다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " Signs and banners outside advertise the "
msgstr " 바깥의 간판과 현수막이 이 전시를 광고한다: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "MALL KATANAS OF THE UNITED STATES"
msgstr "미국의 쇼핑몰 카타나"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "CALL OF GUNS MODERN GUNFARE 20"
msgstr "콜 오브 건즈 모던 건페어 20"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "MEDIEVAL AXES AND ARMS"
msgstr "중세의 도끼와 무기"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "SNACK FOODS OF THE KNOWN WORLD"
msgstr "알려진 세계의 과자"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " exhibit."
msgstr "."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Visit Museum"
msgstr "박물관에 간다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Mystery Factory"
msgstr "정체불명 공장"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " spots a factory whose signs have rusted to nothing. The zombies are "
msgstr "은(는) 간판이 녹슬어 다 사라진 공장을 발견한다. 좀비들이 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "swarming"
msgstr "우글우글"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" over the whole place. There's probably some of whatever the factory made "
"left inside, whatever that was."
msgstr " 몰려 있다. 공장이 뭘 만들었든, 안에 좀 남아 있을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Investigate Factory"
msgstr "공장을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Malicious House"
msgstr "사악한 집"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " runs into a house at the end of a cul-de-sac. It radiates an "
msgstr "은(는) 막다른 골목 끝의 집에 다다른다. 집에서 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "OVERWHELMING"
msgstr "압도적인"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" sense of dread and malice.\r\n"
"\tThere might be a can of food inside!"
msgstr ""
" 공포와 악의가 뿜어져 나온다.\r\n"
"\t안에 통조림 하나쯤 있을지도!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Investigate House"
msgstr "집을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Giant Animal"
msgstr "거대 동물"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" sees a gigantic animal on the side of the road, in the middle of a bunch of"
" stores. Maybe it is a hallucination? Or some sort of trap?"
msgstr "은(는) 가게들 한가운데, 길가에 서 있는 거대한 동물을 본다. 환각일까? 아니면 무슨 함정?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Investigate Animal"
msgstr "동물을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Neighborly Visit"
msgstr "이웃 방문"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "While trying to drive away from a big horde, "
msgstr "큰 좀비 떼를 피해 달아나던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" takes a detour through the deep woods. After taking a wrong turn, they spot"
" a cabin. There's smoke coming from the chimney!"
msgstr "은(는) 깊은 숲으로 우회한다. 길을 잘못 들었다가 오두막을 발견한다. 굴뚝에서 연기가 나고 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "The Truth Is Out There"
msgstr "진실은 저 너머에"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "While driving through the woods, "
msgstr "숲을 달리던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " SEES A UFO AMIDST THE TREES! WHOAAAAAAA!!!!"
msgstr "은(는) 나무 사이에서 UFO를 본다! 우와아아아아!!!!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tWatch out! There's something moving near it!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t조심해! 근처에서 뭔가 움직이고 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Investigate UFO!"
msgstr "UFO를 조사한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Hazmat Rescue"
msgstr "방호복 구출"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " escapes the sewer!"
msgstr "은(는) 하수도를 탈출한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " left before finding everyone, so there was no reward."
msgstr "은(는) 모두를 찾기 전에 떠나서 보상이 없었다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "The entire Hazmat Team made it out alive!"
msgstr "방호복 팀 전원이 살아서 나왔다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
"Not all of the Hazmat Team made it out, but the help was still appreciated."
msgstr "방호복 팀이 전원 살아 나오진 못했지만, 그래도 도와준 걸 고마워한다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " reveals a stash of carefully sealed medical supplies!"
msgstr "은(는) 꼼꼼히 밀봉한 의약품 더미를 공개한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " didn't survive his rescue mission."
msgstr "은(는) 구출 작전에서 살아남지 못했다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:200
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" shows off a cache of food. It may or may not have been stashed in the "
"sewer..."
msgstr "은(는) 식량 더미를 자랑한다. 하수도에 숨겨 뒀던 걸 수도 있고 아닐 수도 있다..."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " didn't make it out of the sewer."
msgstr "은(는) 하수도를 빠져나오지 못했다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " pantomimes some emergency medical techniques."
msgstr "은(는) 응급 처치 요령을 몸짓으로 보여 준다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " was left behind."
msgstr "은(는) 남겨졌다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Hazardous Materials"
msgstr "위험 물질"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" is driving through an empty city when they see a man in the road. He is in "
"a hazmat suit and is beckoning "
msgstr "은(는) 텅 빈 도시를 지나다 길 위의 남자를 본다. 방호복을 입은 그가 손짓한다. 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" for help. As the car gets closer, he opens a manhole and enters the sewer."
msgstr ". 도와 달라는 것이다. 차가 다가가자, 그는 맨홀을 열고 하수도로 들어간다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Go after him!"
msgstr "그를 쫓아간다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Danger Ranger Fan Club"
msgstr "데인저 레인저 팬클럽"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " escapes that swarmed suburb."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비가 들끓던 그 교외를 탈출한다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:234
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " unleashes her Healing Ranger Ray!"
msgstr "은(는) 힐링 레인저 광선을 발사한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " is no longer there to support the group."
msgstr "은(는) 더 이상 일행을 지원해 줄 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " bestows some of her energy and fitness."
msgstr "은(는) 자신의 에너지와 체력을 나눠 준다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " didn't make it. Their team is lessened."
msgstr "은(는) 살아남지 못했다. 그들의 팀이 줄었다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " grants some of his famous strength."
msgstr "은(는) 그 유명한 근력을 나눠 준다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "'s mighty strength will be missed."
msgstr "의 강력한 힘이 그리울 거다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " gives an inspirational pep talk!"
msgstr "은(는) 감동적인 격려 연설을 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " will no longer provide leadership."
msgstr "은(는) 더 이상 리더십을 보여 줄 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " feels inadequate over not finding everyone."
msgstr "은(는) 모두를 찾지 못해 자괴감을 느낀다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Danger Rangers"
msgstr "데인저 레인저"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" sees four people in bright, shiny outfits. They're running around punching "
"zombies and doing little poses. They get overwhelmed by the swarm and flee "
"in different directions."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 번쩍이는 옷을 입은 네 사람을 본다. 뛰어다니며 좀비를 때리고 작은 포즈를 취한다. 그러다 좀비 떼에 압도당해 사방으로 흩어져 "
"도망친다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Try to save them"
msgstr "구해 본다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " gets taught some master-level techniques! "
msgstr "은(는) 달인급 기술을 배운다! "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" now hits even harder!\r\n"
"\t\tNow "
msgstr ""
"는 이제 더 세게 때린다!\r\n"
"\t\t이제 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " hands can hit three targets per attack!"
msgstr " 손은 한 번에 셋을 때릴 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " gets a crash course in martial arts! "
msgstr "은(는) 무술 속성 강좌를 듣는다! "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" is able to learn one very handy move.\r\n"
"\t\tNow "
msgstr ""
"는 아주 유용한 기술 하나를 배운다.\r\n"
"\t\t이제 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " hands are anti-zombie weapons!"
msgstr " 손은 대좀비 무기다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Enter the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드 진입"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " gets out of the car once it drives safely past the swarmed city."
msgstr "은(는) 차가 좀비 떼 가득한 도시를 무사히 빠져나가자 차에서 내린다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:308
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "In return for the help, he teaches "
msgstr "도와준 보답으로 그가 가르쳐 준다. 배우는 사람은 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " an even more advanced form of martial arts!"
msgstr ". 더 고급 무술을!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " how to splat zombies with "
msgstr ". 맨손으로 좀비를 터뜨리는 법을! 무기는 바로 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " bare hands!"
msgstr " 맨손!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:313
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "In thanks for helping "
msgstr "도와준 보답으로 - "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:313
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" offers to teach one person how to splat zombies bare-handed.\r\n"
"\t\t\tWho should get the training?"
msgstr ""
"는 한 사람에게 맨손으로 좀비 터뜨리는 법을 가르쳐 주겠다고 한다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t누가 훈련을 받을까?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Crushing Defeat"
msgstr "참담한 패배"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:319
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid " feels a great sense of loss over "
msgstr "은(는) 큰 상실감을 느낀다. "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:319
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" getting eaten.\r\n"
"\t\tHis martial arts knowledge is now gone."
msgstr ""
"이(가) 먹혀 버렸다.\r\n"
"\t\t그의 무술 지식도 이제 사라졌다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Kung Fu to Canada"
msgstr "캐나다로 가는 쿵후"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "While driving through a very crowded city, "
msgstr "사람으로 북적이는 도시를 지나던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" sees a survivor sneaking through the crowds. He's doing a pretty good job "
"being sneaky, despite his bright yellow jumpsuit."
msgstr "은(는) 군중 사이로 몰래 지나가는 생존자를 본다. 밝은 노란색 점프슈트를 입었는데도 꽤 잘 숨어 다닌다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:331
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Try to reach him"
msgstr "그에게 가 본다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Old Bus Graveyard"
msgstr "낡은 버스 묘지"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:338
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" drives past a large bus garage. Although long-since abandoned, something "
"glimmers still in one of the garages."
msgstr "은(는) 큰 버스 차고를 지나간다. 버려진 지 오래됐지만, 차고 한 곳에서 아직 뭔가 반짝인다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:341
#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:422
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Forget Your Ticket"
msgstr "표는 잊어버려"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Seaside Shanties"
msgstr "해변의 오두막"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:347
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a beach, as sandy and grainy as in childhood memory. On the approach,"
" the faint sound of sea waves draws near..."
msgstr "은(는) 어린 시절 기억처럼 모래가 까끌까끌한 해변을 발견한다. 다가가자, 희미한 파도 소리가 가까워진다..."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Get Sand Between Your Toes"
msgstr "발가락 사이에 모래를"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:355
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Abandoned Warehouse"
msgstr "버려진 창고"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" stumbles across an old, long forgotten warehouse. The exterior of the "
"building is huge - perhaps something still remains inside?"
msgstr "은(는) 오래 잊힌 낡은 창고를 우연히 발견한다. 건물 외관이 엄청 크다. 안에 아직 뭔가 남아 있을까?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:359
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Forget Your Membership Card"
msgstr "회원 카드는 잊어버려"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Forgotten Prison"
msgstr "잊힌 교도소"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:365
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" comes across a prison. Outside, the cameras are still churning left to "
"right. Could somebody still be inside?"
msgstr "은(는) 교도소를 발견한다. 밖의 카메라가 아직도 좌우로 돌아가고 있다. 안에 아직 누가 있을까?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Read Your Miranda Rights"
msgstr "미란다 원칙을 읽어라"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:381
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Putrid Bog"
msgstr "썩은 늪"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" wanders into a marshland. Past the millions of reeds, various objects seem "
"to be glistening in the water. Maybe they're something valuable?"
msgstr "은(는) 습지대에 들어선다. 수많은 갈대 너머 물속에서 여러 물건이 반짝이는 것 같다. 값진 물건일지도?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Put Your Rainboots On"
msgstr "장화를 신어라"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Central Bank"
msgstr "중앙은행"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:392
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" comes across a branch's central bank. Although most of the vaults have "
"likely been looted, perhaps something still remains inside?"
msgstr "은(는) 지점 중앙은행을 발견한다. 금고 대부분은 털렸겠지만, 안에 아직 뭔가 남아 있을지도?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Evade Taxes"
msgstr "탈세하기"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:401
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Maleficent Metro"
msgstr "사악한 지하철"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" is waltzing around an abandoned train station when a metro train shows up. "
"It's one of the new-fangled self-piloting metro trains of the post-2000s "
"era. Who knows where it might go?"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 버려진 기차역을 어슬렁거리다 지하철이 들어오는 걸 본다. 2000년대 이후에 나온 최신식 자율 운행 지하철이다. 어디로 갈지 "
"누가 알겠어?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:404
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "After a minute or two, zombies begin to swarm the train."
msgstr "1~2분 뒤, 좀비들이 열차에 몰려들기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "HOLDOUT! SURVIVE AS LONG AS POSSIBLE!"
msgstr "버텨라! 최대한 오래 살아남아라!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHORDE SIZE: "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t좀비 떼 규모: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "RUSH HOUR"
msgstr "출퇴근 시간"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tCURRENT TIME: "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t현재 시각: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:415
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHOLDOUT LENGTH: "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t버틸 시간: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:416
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "가변"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:417
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "YOU CAN PULL THE STOP LEVERS TO EXIT THE SIEGE!"
msgstr "정지 레버를 당기면 포위전을 빠져나갈 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:428
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Antiquated Citadel"
msgstr "낡은 성채"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:429
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" drives past a checkpoint, right outside of a military citadel. There's "
"boxes of ammo everywhere; clearly some kind of force was holding here. As "
"the group approach the gate, legions of zombies swarm out of nowhere."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 군사 성채 바로 앞 검문소를 지나간다. 사방에 탄약 상자가 있다. 분명 어떤 부대가 여기서 버텼던 거다. 일행이 성문에 "
"다가가자, 좀비 군단이 난데없이 몰려나온다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:432
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Avoid Military Tribunal"
msgstr "군사 재판을 피한다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Dinguswater Station"
msgstr "딩거스워터 역"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:440
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a train depot with lots of containers. Plenty are empty now and for "
"the most part only loadless bogies remain, but maybe some still have loot."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 컨테이너가 많은 기차 차량기지를 발견한다. 지금은 대부분 비었고 빈 화차만 남았지만, 몇 개엔 아직 물자가 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:443
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Steal From Dinguswater Again"
msgstr "딩거스워터에서 또 훔친다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:448
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Reserved Parking"
msgstr "지정 주차"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" peeks inside an old concrete parking lot. It's mostly brimming with rusty "
"cars, although perhaps there's a functioning car left in there still."
msgstr "은(는) 낡은 콘크리트 주차장 안을 들여다본다. 대부분 녹슨 차로 가득하지만, 아직 작동하는 차가 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:452
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Enter Scary Liminal Space"
msgstr "무서운 리미널 스페이스에 들어간다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:457
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "On The Dock of a Bay"
msgstr "부둣가에서"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:458
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" finds an old dockyard. Aside from many rusted machines and felled cranes, "
"there's some containers. Perhaps they'll have loot?"
msgstr "은(는) 오래된 조선소를 발견한다. 녹슨 기계와 쓰러진 크레인 말고도 컨테이너가 몇 개 있다. 물자가 있을까?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Pay Import Duties"
msgstr "수입 관세를 낸다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:466
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "The Village Zombos"
msgstr "마을의 좀보들"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:467
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid ""
" comes across a strange gated village. One of the houses in the distance "
"seems to have a working chimney. Perhaps there's somebody in there?"
msgstr "은(는) 이상하게 문으로 막힌 마을을 발견한다. 멀리 한 집의 굴뚝이 아직 작동하는 것 같다. 안에 누가 있을까?"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df:470
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare1.df"
msgid "Investigate Village"
msgstr "마을을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "Spooky Graveyard"
msgstr "으스스한 묘지"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid ""
" drives past a graveyard. There's not many zombies there, yet it feels "
msgstr "은(는) 묘지를 지나간다. 좀비는 별로 없지만, 느낌이 "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "ominous to a cartoonish extent"
msgstr "만화처럼 불길하다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid ". Faintly, off to the north, spooky goblin laughter can be heard."
msgstr ". 북쪽 멀리서 으스스한 고블린 웃음소리가 희미하게 들린다."

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "Search for Goblin"
msgstr "고블린을 찾는다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "RAGING INFERNO!"
msgstr "맹렬한 화염!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid ""
" runs into a large house that is both swarmed and on fire. What could have caused this so recently? The answer must be inside.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 좀비가 들끓는 데다 불까지 붙은 큰 집에 다다른다. 이렇게 최근에 무슨 일이 있었던 걸까? 답은 안에 있을 거다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "WARNING:"
msgstr "경고:"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid " CONTENTS MAY BE HOT"
msgstr " 내용물이 뜨거울 수 있음"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "Dive into fire"
msgstr "불 속으로 뛰어든다"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "Gothic Farm"
msgstr "고딕 농장"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid ""
" sees a farm swarmed by an angry horde. Two old-fashioned farmers run into "
"their house. They could still be saved!"
msgstr "은(는) 성난 좀비 떼에 휩싸인 농장을 본다. 옛날식 농부 두 사람이 집 안으로 뛰어든다. 아직 구할 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "Try to save them!"
msgstr "구해 보자!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "Haunted Mansion"
msgstr "유령의 저택"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid ""
" runs into a super spooky mansion. It is dark and, no question, it's "
"haunted. You might get to talk to some "
msgstr "은(는) 엄청 으스스한 저택에 다다른다. 어둡고, 의심할 여지 없이 귀신이 나온다. 이것들과 대화하게 될지도: "

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid ""
"GHOSTS!\r\n"
"\tWARNING:"
msgstr ""
"유령!\r\n"
"\t경고:"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid " FLASHLIGHT RECOMMENDED! VERY DANGEROUS!"
msgstr " 손전등 지참 권장! 매우 위험!"

#: deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/rareloc/rare2.df"
msgid "Explore Mansion"
msgstr "저택을 탐색한다"
